   "text": "My time with Tech Academia has come to an end!\n\nBuilding Tech Academia has been a challenging but rewarding experience. Being a startup founder taught me many invaluable skills. From raising funding, to learning sales & marketing, to further developing my software engineering skills, it\u2019s safe to say I\u2019ve learnt a lot. However, all good things must come to an end.\n\nDespite this moment marking the end of one journey, it marks the beginning of a new one. The next phase of my career will be focused on further developing my software engineering fundamentals. My hypothesis is that, as AI systems become more efficient, there will be a higher demand for engineers with deep understanding of system a",
