  "7524478265814618112": {
   "created": 1793975416,
   "author": "Paul Heydon",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/pheydon_its-been-a-long-time-since-i-shared-an-update-activity-7524478265814618112-pR7B",
   "text": "It\u2019s been a long time since I shared an update on me, so consider this a catch-up.\n\nSince 2021 I have been running my own family office, investing across venture (direct and as an LP in funds and SPVs), hedge funds (LP), private equity (LP) and public equities (direct).\nOutreach is minimal. Most things arrive inbound from friends and my network, which suits me.\n\nA bit of history for context.\n\nI started my career in 1990 in Toronto as a founder straight out of undergrad and failed in the food sector. I then worked in the food sector, co-founded a startup in the sports sector, raised money and failed again.\n\nI got my MBA in 1999, moved to London and joined an investment bank working with media",
